      "question": "The governmental taxes 'Other' line 6,002.51 is labelled 'In lieu of tax' on the budgetary comparison schedule (p8) but 'Public power district sales tax' on the General (4,354.39) and Debt Service (1,648.12) fund schedules. Which label should it carry?",
