      "question": "The Sewer and Water fund's 850.26 is printed as part of Charges for services - Sewer and water on the proprietary statement (p7, 55,335.88) but as 'Other general receipts' on the Statement of Activities (p3) and 'Miscellaneous' on the fund schedule (p13). Should it count as utility charges or other?",
